<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Uroma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi Uroma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uroma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Urom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uroma</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uroma</para>
  <para style="ip">Awu Uburhu unga atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Uburhu atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ adɛyiwe itsinga ra abika adɔsa ru Uroma na adɔrha azĩ umɔ, ubinkutsu unga anasi izĩa iyepa abika adɔsa umɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Undzuma arherha ha ru ubvur uwurɛ uwe ru (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:16-17">1.16-17</ref></char>). Ubvur ha ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum isi igũmum atsa idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize, ubinkutsu ngge iwu ijee Unum iyiriyɛ iki ikũ ififɔrh iyi abika awe ru imangmang, utirhi ra abi Uyahuda uzĩ utsĩ atsen abi Uyahuda ... Irhirhikayɛ iki iwe ri imangmang iyi inggbaashia izĩ itsĩ imimasha&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubvur uwurɛ udɛyiwe ugɛ anera kishoo ru upfung awe ru ubok ijee arhim, na awu abirabɛ Unum iki itsu umbɔ uvau (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:8-3:20">1.8—3.20</ref></char>). Udɛyiwe ikɛi ugɛ awu ru ubok imangmang ru Uyesu Ukiristo iwuri itsu unera awe uner uku usheru uvau ra asu Unum, asi iwea ru ubok abinkɛ unera iki ikorhe nibikanga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3.21—4.25</ref></char>). Ubvur ha ikɛi udɛyiwe ikpũ ibibɛkyɛ iki iwu ufang abika adɔsa awe ra ake. Ikɛi udɛyiwe ugɛ ibibɛk ri ijee Ipfu Isarsatangge iki isaki ikũ igha inggbaashi ra amɛn aki iyor (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5.1—8.39</ref></char>). Ubvur ha ikɛi udɛyiwe abinkɛ Unum aka angwɛ̃ ikorhe ri ififɔrh iwe iyi anera kishoo, abi Uyahuda nu abirabɛ aka asi iwembɔ abi Uyahuda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9.1—11.36</ref></char>). Ri imimasha, umbɔ arherha arherhe ri itsi ikpũ ibibɛkyɛ abika adɔsa nggu angwɛ̃mbɔ nu ikpũ ibibɛk abika adɔsa nggu anggbaashi abi abĩã (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12.1—15.13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:1-17">1.1-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kishoo abi upfung awu abi arhim <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1.18—3.20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Udĩ uku ukpo ififɔrh <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3.21—4.25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Urhɛ uku ufa ru Ukiristo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5.1—8.39</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Abinkɛ Unum aka angwɛ̃ ri itsi abi Uisrairha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9.1—11.36</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ikpũ ibibɛkyɛ iki imɛ̃ɛ̃ uner uku udɔsa awerangge <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12.1—15.13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15.14—16.27</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Idzeku umum Uburhu, uner itser Ukiristo Uyesu. Umbɔ aka ayisa umum iwe uner itser Uyesu, atsũ umum idũwũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Unum. <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Unum aka abemuwe akũ abika asɔm Arherhu-Num ishaisha, ru nyaka umbɔ aka atsɛng ra asarkasar abvur Arherhu-Num, <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>ri itsi Ungwɛ̃nga ri iyornga awe unang Udauda. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Umbɔ abema agɛ unga awe Ungwɛ̃ Unum ri isisoknga ra akpe ri ijee Ipfu Isarsatangge. Unga awu Uyesu Ukiristo Uteijeemɛn. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Ru uboknga Unum aka adzaa umɛn imimuta na ayisa umɛn iwe abi itser Uyesu nggee umɛn iwuri iyisa kishoo atsen abi Uyahuda aba awe ru imangmang na adɔsa. Umɛn ikorhe akɛrɛ ha ri itsoknga. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Umbi ikɛi awu ra abirabɛ umbɔ aka ayisa ra atsen abi Uyahuda umbɔ awe abi Uyesu Ukiristo.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Umum inu itsɛnge ru kishoo abika awe ru Uroma Unum aka abema ayisa umbi awe asasar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Imimuta nu ididɔɔr iki idzeku Unum Utɛmɛn nu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo iwe nggu umbi.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu abee iyepa Uroma rimɔ̃ɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Umum inggbaashia, itar uwɛɛ ru Unummum ri itsok Uyesu Ukiristo ru umbi kishoo, ubinkutsu aka asɔmukumbɔ isarhe imangmangmbi ru upfunga kishoo. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Umum itɔ̃we Unum itser nggu amɛnmum kishoo ri idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Ungwɛ̃nga, Unum awu idekamum iki iyita umbi <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>ubɛn ivangyɛ umum iki ifɛn-Num. Umum ifɛna unga aba abemunga, unga ama utsuruwa utsĩndĩã ru umum ĩba ru umbi.<verse eid="ROM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Umum ibee inyã umbi akarhãrhã ni ĩdzaa umbi izũwã iyɔɔ iyi Ipfu Isarsatangge iyiki itsu umbi aker. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Ugɛ iwuri itsu umum nu umbi ifituwe adɔka ri imangmangmɛn. <verse eid="ROM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Umum isi ĩbeemum umbi awe ru ida ihwihwɛng umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ugɛ umum ibee ĩba ru umbi idikunga irhɛirhɛ, bɔr umum isi ikpomum ivanga utsɛku icɛrɛ. Umum ibee ikpo igbɛr abin ru umbi, ru nyaka umum iki ikpo ra atsen abi Uyahuda abɔɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Umum iwemum ru uvɛrh anera kishoo, abi Uyahuda nu atsen abi Uyahuda, abi isarasu nu agugge. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Ngge itsu umum itsu amɛnmum idũwũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize ru umbi abirabɛ aka awe ru Uroma ikɛi.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ijee Isarhe Iyiki Ize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Umum isi igũmum atsa idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize, ubinkutsu ngge iwu ijee Unum iyiriyɛ iki ikũ ififɔrh iyi abika awe ru imangmang, utirhi ra abi Uyahuda uzĩ utsĩ atsen abi Uyahuda. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Awu Isarhe Iyiki Ize ha idɛyiwa umɛn ugɛ Unum anyanga umɛn iwe abika arhika, irhirhikayɛ iki iwe ri imangmang iyi inggbaashia izĩ itsĩ imimasha, ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwuku urhika awuri ibɛk ri imangmang.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Uha 2.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Avɔm Unum ra abi arhim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Avɔm Unum adzeka ra afã aba nu atsi abirabɛ aka ashimbɔ ru Unum nu abika awe ri iyiki ibewe anera aki adɛmu idzidzɛrhe ri iyiki ibewambɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Abinkɛ umbɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ahwɛng ri itsi Unum uwu ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asumbɔ, ubinkutsu Unum aka ayanguka ake ra asumbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Udzur ri imimunu upfunga iwiweyɛ Unum aka awe umbɔ aka asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ inyãmbɔ, iyiriyɛ iki iwu ijeenga iyi ugbagbaa nu abinkɛ aka adɛyiwa ugɛ unga awu Unum, aka anyã ake ukupɛ̃ɛ̃. Anyã ake ra abinkɛ unga aka amuna, ngge itsú anera asi iwembɔ ru ubin ukpuku urherhe uku uka arhimmbɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Ahwɛngmbɔ Unum, na asi ikpoimbɔ unga aka awe Unum, asi itarmbɔ uwɛɛ ru unga. Ifɛrhkɔmbɔ iwe ibɛm nu amɛnmbɔ awe uzĩ. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Umbɔ anu igɔr agɛ umbɔ asarasu, bɔr awu agugge <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>na afaruwe ikpikpoi Unum adzowe ra agberhekɛ aka awe ru nyaka anera nu anunu nu íjuɛ nu abinkɛ aki ikaikai ra abĩ.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Nggee Unum aneke umbɔ, ngge itsú umbɔ akorhu abin arhim iyiki ibewe amɛnmbɔ iki ibee. Umbɔ akorhu abin atsa nggu adɔkambɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Umbɔ adzipu idzidzɛrhe Unum ngge iwe igbɛrangwĩ, anu idzowe igɔng ra abinkɛ umbɔ aka amuna na akpɛ̃mbɔ uwuku umumuna uwu ikpikpoi ugbagbaa. Iwerimi.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Nggee Unum aneke umbɔ nggu ikpona iyiki ikũ atsa. Uko atsɛ̃mbɔ akpɛ̃mbɔ irha nggu atsakmbɔ bɔr arha nggu akatsɛrh. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Rimi hã akatsak akpɛ̃mbɔ irha akatsɛrh ngge iki iwe ubinkpi Unum aka amuna na awu ra anyɔna nggu adɔkambɔ akatsak. Akatsak nu akatsak aka isaka arha adɔkambɔ, na ayɛi avau itser iyiki ibewambɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Umbɔ akpɛ̃mbɔ iwe nggu ihwihwɛng Unum, nggee Unum aneke umbɔ ri ifɛrhkɔ iyiki itãrhãmbɔ, ngge itsú umbɔ akorha abinkɛ aka asi imɛ̃ke umbɔ akorhe. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Umbɔ awe nggu ikpũ iyiki ibewe, nu ikpona nu amɛn aka abewe. Awu nggu unyɛ̃ɛ̃, nu ifɛr uner, nu ifuw, nu ikpikpɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>Umbɔ awe abika avɛrha anera, abika akpɛ̃ Unum, abi ugbau, abika aberi itsi, abika afĩrhã, abika angwɛ̃ amɛnmbɔ ri iki ibewe, asi itĩmbɔ atei, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>abika asheri itsoi, abika asheri imangmang, abika ashera amɛn, abika ashera atorh. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ Íkpem iyiki irhika iyi Unum iki igɔr igɛ abika akorha abina akɛrɛ imɛ̃ngge umbɔ akpe, umbɔ asi ikorhumbɔ akɛrɛ ha ukpekũ, bɔr umbɔ ikɛi abema abika akorha ake.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Itsu uvau Unum iyiki irhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Nggee ungo ushiɔ ru urhɛm, ungo uwuku utsu uvau ru uwɔɔ, ungo uba utsu uvau ru uwɔɔ, ungo utsu uvau ri itsingo. Ubinkutsu, ungo uner uwuku utsu uvau ha, ungo uni ukorhe ru nyaku uner uwuku uwe ru uvau. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ itsu uvau iyi Unum ru abika akorhe rimi hã iwe idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Nggee, ungo uner uwuku utsu uvau ra abɔɔ, nu uni ukorhe iki ibewe ugɛɛ umbɔ, ungo ukaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ ungo uwuri ishɔɔtɔ ri itsu uvau Unum? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Use ungo ukwɛɛte urhɛrhɛ innanga, nu inineke nu idɔngamɛn? Ungo usi ihwɛngo ugɛ inna Unum ikũna ungo izĩ idzidzipa?<verse eid="ROM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Bɔr iker itsingo nu ida idzidzipa amɛnngo ngge itsu ungo unu ikɔng avɔm ri itsingo ru unum avɔm Unum, ri ivang iyiki itsu uvau iyiki irhika iyi Unum iki idzeka. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Unum awuri idzowe ubɛn unera ugbɛtɛ ubinkpi unga aka akorhe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Amb 62.12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Abika atɔ̃ itser abima ri ikorhu ubin uku uze na abee ikpikpoi, imor nu urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, Unum awuri idzowe umbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Bɔr abika abema atsimbɔ na akpɛ̃mbɔ idzidzɛrhe na adɔsu iyiki ibewe, awuri itsĩ ra avɔm Unum. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Uver nu ayetnum awuri iwe nggu ubɛn unera aka akorhe iki ibewe, agbaashia akorhuwe abi Uyahuda, mɔcɛ atsen abi Uyahuda. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Bɔr ikpikpoi, igɔng nu ididɔɔr iwuri iwe nggu uwuku ukorhi iyiki ize, igbaashia iwe nggu abi Uyahuda, mɔcɛ atsen abi Uyahuda. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Unum asi itɛnga asu.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Abirabɛ aka asi ihwɛngmbɔ Íkpem na agba ra arhim, arhimmbɔ awuri itsĩme umbɔ, bɔr abirabɛ aka ahwɛng Íkpem na agba ra arhim, Íkpem iwuri itsĩme umbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Ubinkutsu, asi iwea abika agũ Íkpem awu abika arhika ru Unum, bɔr Unum awuri inyanga abika adɔsi Íkpem awu abika arhika. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Rimi hã, atsen abi Uyahuda, abika asheri Íkpem, ivang iyɔɔ umbɔ akorhumbɔ abin akɔɔ aka awe ri Íkpem. Awembɔ ri Íkpem ra amɛnmbɔ, uko umbɔ aka ashimbɔ nu Íkpem. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Itsermbɔ itsu anera ahwɛng ugɛ abinkɛ Íkpem iki igɔr, atsɛngmbɔ ake ra amɛnmbɔ. Ifɛrhkɔ amɛnmbɔ ikɛi idɛyiwe ugɛ iwe idzidzɛrhe. Ngge iki iwe ugɛ ifɛrhkɔmbɔ isaki itsu uvau ru umbɔ, ivang iyɔɔ ngge ikaa umbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Akɛrɛ ha awuri iwe ru unumkpi Unum aka itsu uvau ri iwiwɔk amɛn anera ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo, ru nyaka Isarhe Iyiki Izemum iki irherhe.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi Uyahuda ha nu Íkpem Umusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Ungo uner uwuku uyisi itsingo uner Uyahuda. Ungo utsukɔ amɛnngo ri Íkpem nu ufĩrhã ri iwɛrhɛngo nggu Unum. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Ungo umesungo Íkpem ha. Ungo uhwɛngo ubinkpi unga aka abee ungo ukorhe, nu ubemu ubin uku uze. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Ungo akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ ungo udarh abi ibvuta, irhirhang ra abi uzĩ. <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Ungo ukaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ ungo uwu uner uwuku umesuwe agugge, uwuku umesuwe awɛkaci, ubinkutsu ungo ukaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ ri Íkpem ungo uku ukpo ihwihwɛng nu idzidzɛrhe kishoo. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Nggee, ungo, uner uwuku umesuwe anera, ungo usi imesukɔ itsingo? Ungo uner uwuku udũwã ugɛ niba avɛumbɔ ivɛu, ungo uvɛpɔ ivɛu? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Ungo uner uwuku ugɔr ugɛ niba atomumbɔ-dak, ungo utomungo-dak? Ungo uner uwuku ugũ ishĩ ugberhe, ungo uvɛpɔ ivɛu ru abã agberhe? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Ungo uwuku ufĩrhã nggu Íkpem, ungo usi idakukɔ itsok Unum ri izharhuwe Íkpemnga? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi atsu atsen abi Uyahuda arhenu Unum.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Uish 52.5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:22">Ueze 36.22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Usorhe uwekpɔ ru ugarh, ungo uba udɔsungo Íkpem, bɔr ungo uba uzharhukɔ Íkpem, ungo uwe ru nyaku uwuruwi aka ashia ru usorhe. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Nggee, abika asheru usorhe aba adɔsumbɔ abinkɛ Íkpem iki irherhe, asi ínyãnga umbɔ awembɔ ru nyaka abi usorhe? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Uwuruwi aka ashia ru usorhe nu iyornga na adɔsunga abinkɛ Íkpem iki irherhe, awuri itsuka uvau ru ungo uwuku uwe ru Íkpem nu usorhe, bɔr ungo uzharhukɔ Íkpem hã.<verse eid="ROM 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Unera asi iwea uner Uyahuda unga aba akpurha awu Uyahuda uwu iyor, usorhe usi iwekpɔ utsar ukpu iyor ukpekũ anera aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ anyã. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Ĩ'ĩ, unera awu Uyahuda uwu idzidzɛrhe unga aba awea ra amɛnnga, usorhe ukpu idzidzɛrhe uwe ukpu amɛn, ukpurukpi Ipfu-Num iki isaki ikorhe, asi iwea Ikpem. Ikpũ uner uwɛrɛ awu Unum akpoi unga, asi iwea anera.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Idzidzɛrhe Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Abi Uyahuda anang atsen nggu use, nggu ugarh use nggu uwe ru usorhe? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Ĩĩ, uwe urhɛrhɛ ru ubɛn udĩ! Ri inggbaashia, umbɔ adzowe abi Uyahuda Arherhu-Num.<verse eid="ROM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Iwuri iwe iguse abɔɔ aba ashimbɔ ri imangmang? Isheri imangmangmbɔ iwuri itsũwũkũngge imangmang Unum? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Ĩ'ĩ! Ishingge! Unum awe idzidzɛrhe, nu ngge iki iwu ugɛ anera kishoo awe abi igbɛrangwĩ. Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Ngge itsu umbɔ adɛyiwe ugɛ ungo urhika ivangyɛ ungo iki irherha arherhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">nu ugha inggbaashi ri ivangyɛ ungo uku itsu uvau.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Amb 51.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Bɔr uba ida irhirhikamɛn ikũ irhirhika Unum idzeka ukupɛ̃ɛ̃, umɛn igɔr uguse? Umɛn igɔr ugɛ Unum asi irhikunga unga aka atsu avɔmnga ru umɛn? Aner abɔɔ arherhe ri iminɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Ĩ'ĩ! Ishingge rimi! Iba iwe rimi, Unum awuri ikorha aguse na atsu uvau ru upfung? <verse eid="ROM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Uwɔɔ awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ arherhunga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ida idzidzɛrhamum iba itsu idzidzɛrhe Unum idzekangge ri idzowe igɔng ru Unum, awu use utsu umbɔ atsu uvau ru umum ra arhimmum?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Awu ugɛ umbɔ anu irherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Iba iwe rimi, mɔcɛ umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ ĩgɔrmɛn ugɛ umɛn ikorha iyiki ibewe nu iyiki ize iba?&gt;&gt; Abɔɔ abika arherhi iyiki ibewe nu atsimɛn anu igɔr ugɛ umɛn irherhe aki ha! Awuri itsĩme umbɔ ri iwiwembɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwuku urhika ashia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Umɛn irherhe iguse ra akɛrɛ? Umɛn abi Uyahuda inangmɛn abɔɔ? Ĩ'ĩ, Ishingge rimi! Umɛn iki itsu atsimɛn ugɛ abi Uyahuda nu atsen abi Uyahuda kishoo umɛn iwe ri ijee arhim. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Uner uwuku urhurhika ashia, uko unying.<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Uwuku uhwuhwɛng ashia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">uwuku ubee Unum ashia<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Kishoo aka adzipu undzingmbɔ ru Unum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">kishoo aka awe ibɛm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">uwuku ikorhe iyiki ize ashia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">uko unying.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Amb 14.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:20">Uner 7.20</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>&lt;&lt;Ru nyaku inuk iki ibewe iki isaki idzeyiwa ra adzak aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ iyɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">rimi hã irhɛm iyiki ibewe iki isaki idzeyiwa ra angwĩmbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Arhɛmmbɔ atɔ̃ itser irhirhɛm.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Amb 5.9</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm angwĩmbɔ iwu ungguma íghwɛr.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 140:3">Amb 140.3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>&lt;&lt;Angwĩmbɔ atɔk nggu urhena uku ukperek.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Amb 10.7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>&lt;&lt;Adakmbɔ afɛ̃rhĩ itsu adzirh,<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>igba abĩ nu ihwa uver iwu utsar atsĩndĩmbɔ,<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>ikɛi asi ihwɛngmbɔ atsĩndĩ ididɔɔr.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:7">Uish 59.7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:8">8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>&lt;&lt;Ashimbɔ ri iwei Unum ra asumbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Amb 36.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Awu idzidzɛrhe umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ubinkpi Íkpem iki irherhe, irherhe nggu abirabɛ aka awe ru uzirhzĩ Íkpem, ngge itsú ubɛn angwĩ awe uku uveb, nu kishoo upfung aka agbambɔ ra asu Unum. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Nggee asi ínyangu unera awea uner uwuku urhika ru utsĩndĩ uwuku udɔsi Íkpem Umusa. Ubinkpi Íkpem Umusa iki ikorhe, idɛyiwe unera ihwɛng arhimnga.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhirhika ru ubok imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Bɔr icɛrɛ Unum aka adɛyiwanga utsĩndĩwi uku itsu unga anyanga umɛn iwe uku urhirhiki. Asi iwea ri Íkpem Umusa. Íkpem Umusa nu abvur abika asɔm Arherhu-Num adzowuke ideka ri itsingge. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Irhirhika ha adzowe ngge ru ubok imangmang ru Uyesu Ukiristo ru kishoo abika awe ru imangmang. Asi iwiwembɔ, <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>anera kishoo awe ra arhim, na afɔr itsitsĩ ru igɔng Unum adambɔ, <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>bɔr unga anyanga umɛn iwe abika arhika ri izũwã imimutayɛ unga aka adzaa umɛn. Unga akorhe akɛrɛ ru ubok Ukiristo Uyesu ri ivangyɛ unga aka ashɔɔte umɛn. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Unum adzowe Uyesu unga awu idɛm-Num iyiki inyãnguwe ugbɛtɛ arhim. Ra adzirhnga umbɔ aka atsũwe arhim anera ri ivangyɛ umbɔ aka awe ru imangmang. Unum akorhe akɛrɛ adeyiwa ugɛ unga arhika, ubinkutsu unga aka asi itsuka uvau ra arhim anera aki isha. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Unga akorha ake adɛyiwe irhirhikanga ri ivang iyɛrɛ. Unga arhika, na anyanga kishoo abirabɛ aka awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu awu abika arhika.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Nggee unera adɛ̃ɛ̃ ifĩrhũnga? Ĩ'ĩ. Awu idɔsu Íkpem Umusa itsu umɛn irhika? Ĩ'ĩ, awu ru imangmang. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Umɛn igɔr ugɛ iwe ru ubok imangmang Unum aka anyanga anera awu abika arhika, asi iwea itser Íkpem Umusa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Unum awu Unum uwu abi Uyahuda ukpekũ? Asi iwea uwu atsen abi Uyahuda ikɛi? Ĩĩ awea, <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>ngge iki iwe ugɛ Unum awu unying. Unga awuri inyanga abi usorhe awu abika arhika ru ubok imangmang, rimi hã abika asheru usorhe awu abika arhika ru ubok imangmang iyɛrɛ ha. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Umɛn iki itsũwũkumɛn Íkpem Umusa ri imangmang iyɛrɛ? Uko ukunjiir! Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, umɛn ikpɔm nggu Íkpem hã.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Uibrahim ashia ru uvau <optbreak/> ra asu Unum ri imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Umɛn irherhu uguse ri itsi Uibrahim, utoku atokamɛn ri iyor? Ihwihwɛngnga iwu use ra akɛrɛ ha? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Unum aba anyangu Uibrahim awu uner uwuku urhika ru ubok itseryɛ Uibrahim iki itɔ̃, unga awea ru ubinkpi unga aka ikũ afĩrhã nukpɔ, bɔr asi iwea ra asu Unum. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr ugɛ use? &lt;&lt;Uibrahim awe ru imangmang ru Unum, ngge itsu umbɔ anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ing 15.6</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Unera aba atɔ̃ itser, itosanga isi iwengge izũwã, bɔr iwu itosi itsernga. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Bɔr, unerwi aka asi itɔ̃ itser na akpurha atsu amɛnnga ru Unum uwuruwi iki inyanga abika abewe awe abika arhika, iwu imangmang uner ha iwuri itsu unga arhika ru Unum. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Udauda arherhe rimi ivangyɛ unga aka arherhe ugɛ unerwi Unum aka asi inyanga unga awea uner uwuku urhika ru ubok itseryɛ uner ha aka atɔ̃, idorh iwe nggu uner ha. Unga agɔr agɛ,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>&lt;&lt;Idorh iwu iyi abirabɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">umbɔ aka atsũwe avaumbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">abirabɛ umbɔ aka atsire arhimmbɔ.<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Idorh iwe nggu uner ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">Uteijee aka asi ivarhunga arhimnga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 32:1">Amb 32.1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 32:2">2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Idorh iyɛrɛ iwe ra abi usorhe ukpekũ, use nggu abika asheru usorhe ikɛi? Umɛn iki irherhumɛn ugɛ imangmang Uibrahim itsu umbɔ anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika. <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Iwe ra akasong umbɔ aka anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika? Awe ru unga aka asorhu usorhe amaa, use unga aka anasi isorhunga usorhe? Anasi isorhukumbɔ unga usorhe. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Bɔr unga ayɛi usorhe ru nyaku utsar. Ake adɛyiwe ugɛ Unum anyangu Uibrahim awu uner uwuku urhika ru ubok imangmang ri ivangyɛ unga aka anasi isorhunga usorhe. Nggee Uibrahim awu utɛ ru kishoo abika awe ru imangmang ru Unum, abirabɛ aka anasi isorhmbɔ usorhe, ngge itsú umbɔ anyanga umbɔ awu abika arhika. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Rimi hã ikɛi Uibrahim awu utei ra abi usorhe abirabɛ aka asi iwea usorhe ukpekũ umbɔ aka awe ru ukpɔ, bɔr adɔsumbɔ ikpũ imangmang iyi Uibrahim, unga awe ru imangmang hã na adɔrha asorhu usorhe.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibibemuwe-Num nu imangmang unera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Asi iwea ri Íkpem Uibrahim nu unangnga aka ayɛi ibibemuwe agɛ unga awuri igha ukam upfunga, bɔr awu ri irhirhika iyiki iba ru ubok imangmang. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Uba awu abika adɔsi Íkpem umbɔ awuri igha ukam, imangmang iwu ibɛm nu ibibemuwe ishingge ru ugarh, <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>ubinkutsu Íkpem Umusa ini ikũ itsu uvau iba. Nu anangkɛ íkpem iki ishingge, izharhuwe íkpem ishingge.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Nggee, ibibemuwe iba ru ubok imangmang. Ngge iwu ru ubok imimuta unang Uibrahim kishoo aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ awe ru ikeramɛn ugɛ umbɔ awuri iyɛimbɔ ngge. Asi iwea abirabɛ aka adɔsi Íkpem ukpekũ, bɔr nggu abirabɛ aka awe ru imangmang ru nyaku Uibrahim. Unga awu utɛmɛn kishoo. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum itsu ungo uwe utɛ abĩã arhɛrhɛ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Ing 17.5</ref></char>.</note> Unga awu utɛmɛn ra asu Unum uwuruwi unga aka awe ru imangmang ru unga, Unumwi iki idzowe urhɛ ra abika akpukpe, na awe ru ijee iyisa abinkɛ aka ashike awe.<verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Nu ifosa iki ishingge, Uibrahim akpurha atsu amɛnnga awe ru imangmang. Ngge itsu unga iwe utɛ abĩã arhɛrhɛ ru nyaka umbɔ aka adɛyiwe unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unangngo uwuri iwe urhɛrhɛ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Ing 15.5</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Imɛk Uibrahim iwu unaka, iker iyornga iki imaangge ri ikɔ̃ner, nu ivang imar Usaratu iki itɔngngge ru unga, bɔr Uibrahim asi idɔ̃rhũnga ri imangmangnga. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Asi icanga ibibemuwe-Num na nekuka imangmangnga, bɔr atoma awe ru iker ri imangmangnga, anu ikpoi Unum. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Unga awe nggu undzumu ihwihwɛng ugɛ Unum awea ri ijee iyiki itsu ibibemuwenga iwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Ngge itsu umbɔ anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Irhɛm hã umbɔ aka atsɛng ngge agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika,&gt;&gt; asi itsɛngmbɔ ngge ri itsinga ikiyikanga, <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>bɔr ikɛi nggu umɛn. Awuri inyanga umɛn iwe abika arhika, abirabɛ aka awe ru imangmang ru uwuku usoyiwe Uyesu Uteijeemɛn ra akpe. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Awe arhimmɛn atsu umbɔ adzowe unga ra akpe, na asoyiwe unga nggu urhɛ, ru umɛn ikpo isheru uvau ra asu Unum.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ididɔɔr nu ifosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Unum aka anyanga umɛn iwu abika arhika ru ubok imangmang. Nggee, umɛn iwemɛn ri ididɔɔr nggu Unum ru ubok Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Unga atsu umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ itsĩ ri imimutanga, umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ nú ngge icɛrɛ. Umɛn igɔmagɔm ri itsi umɛn iki iwe ru ifosa ugɛ umɛn iwuri ikpomɛn igɔng iyi Unum. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Asi iwea rimi ukpekũ, bɔr umɛn iwemɛn ra anggɔm ra ayetnummɛn, ubinkutsu umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ayetnum ikũwã umɛn ibibima, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>ibibima ngge ikũwã umɛn amɛn aka aze, amɛn aka aze ake ikũwã umɛn ifosa. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Ifosa ha isi ítsu umɛn igũmɛn atsa, ubinkutsu Unum aka awupuwa ibibemanga ra amɛnmɛn ru ubok Ipfu Isarsatangge, unga aka adzaa umɛn.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Àka anyã, ri ivangyɛ umɛn iki ishimɛn ri iker, ivang hã niyɔ Ukiristo akpe ri itsi abika asheru Unum. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Aghong unera aka ikpe ri itsi uner uwuku urhika. Use uwɔɔ awuri ibemunga ikpe ri itsi uner amɛn aka aze. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Bɔr Unum adɛyiwa umɛn ibibemanga riminɛ, Ukiristo akpe ri itsimɛn ri ivangyɛ umɛn iki iwe abi arhim.<verse eid="ROM 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Unum anyanga umɛn iwu abika arhika ru ubok adzirh Uyesu. Icicang ishingge, umɛn iwuri ikpomɛn ififɔrh ra avɔm Unum ru uboknga! <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Isha umɛn iwe anggamtsak Unum, bɔr unga aka agbishuwa iwɛrhɛmɛn nggu unga ru ubok akpe Ungwɛ̃nga. Icicang ishingge, unga aba amaa igbishuwa iwɛrhɛmɛn, umbɔ awuri ifɔrha umɛn ru ubok ibibɛk Ukiristo! <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Inangngge rimi, bɔr umɛn ikɛi ifĩrhã Unum ru ubinkpi unga aka akorhe ru ubok Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo, icɛrɛ unga aka atsu umɛn iwe awɛrhu Unum.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpe adzeku Uadamu, <optbreak/> bɔr urhɛ udzeku Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Arhim atsĩwã ru upfung ru ubok unera unying, arhim akũwã umɛn akpe. Rimi hã akpe aka akpo anera kishoo, ubinkutsu kishoo awu ra arhim. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Awu idzidzɛrhe, arhim aweke ru upfung nu umbɔ adɔrha adzowe Íkpem Umusa, bɔr asi ivarhumbɔ arhim, ubinkutsu íkpem ina ishingge. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Rimi hã akpe agha iyɛrhe anera udzur ri ivang Uadamu uba utsĩ ivang Umusa. Akpe agha atsi anera, uko abirabɛ aka asi izharhukumbɔ ikpem, ru nyaku Uadamu aka akorhe. Uadamu awu unyaka uwɔɔ aka iba nggu izũwũ Unum.<verse eid="ROM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Bɔr izũwã hã Unum aka adzowe ru uwuku ububa ha isi iwengge ru nyaka arhim Uadamu. Awu idzidzɛrhe ugɛ arhim unera unying hã akowe akpe ra anera arhɛrhɛ. Bɔr imimutu Unum irhɛngge, ngge itsú izũwãyɛ unga aka akorhe ru unera unying hã Uyesu Ukiristo, ngge ikũwã nggaa igũibɛn ra anera arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Iwe rimi, izũwũ Unum iwiwengge nggu arhim unera unying hã. Awu ufaikpi uku udɔsu undzing unera unying hã uku uwu uvau akpe, bɔr izũwãyɛ Unum aka adzaa ngge ikũwã ufai uner uwuku usheru uvau unying ra asunga ra arhimmɛn arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Uba awu arhim unera unying atsu akpe agha iyɛrhe anera arhɛrhɛ, nggaa imimutu Unum nu izũwã iyi irhirhikanga inangge, ubinkutsu kishoo uwuku uyɛi ngge awuri ibɛk ru ubok unera unying hã, Uyesu Ukiristo.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Ngge iki iwe rimi, ru nyaka arhim unera unying aka akowe ufai akpe ra anera kishoo, ngge rimi hã itser iyiki irhika unera unying iki ikowe isheru uvau nggu urhɛ ra anera kishoo. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Ida ididɔsa uwu unera unying itsu anera arhɛrhɛ awe abi arhim, rimi hã ididɔsa uwu unera unying ikɛi itsu anera arhɛrhɛ awe abika arhika.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Akũ Íkpem Umusa aba ngge itsú anera anyã arhimmbɔ. Bɔr arhim anera aba atomuke, imimutu Unum iki isaki itoma irhɛirhɛ, <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>ru nyaka arhim aka agha iyɛrhe ra anera kishoo na akũ umbɔ azĩ ra akpe, rimi hã ikɛi imimutu Unum iki igha iyɛrhe igangge ni itsu umɛn iwu abika arhika ru Unum, ni ikũwã umɛn urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo Uteijeemɛn.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Akpe ra arhim, urhɛ ru Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Umɛn ĩgɔr ugɛ use? Umɛn ikorha arhim ru imimuta itoma? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Ishingge! Ra arherha arhim, ngge iwe ugɛɛ umɛn iki ikpemɛn, awu use utsu umɛn ibɛk ra ake ikɛi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ugɛ umɛn ru ubok ubɔtisimamɛn umbɔ aka agbopa umɛn nggu Ukiristo Uyesu nu akpenga? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Ru ubok ubɔtisimamɛn ngge iwe ugɛɛ umɛn iki ikpe, ikɛi ugɛɛ umbɔ aka adzake umɛn nggu Ukiristo. Umbɔ akorha akɛrɛ ha ngge itsú umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ iwe ru urhɛ uwuku ufa, ru nyaku Ukiristo aka asok ra akpe ru ubok igɔng Utɛ.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Uba umɛn ĩgbopa iwu unying nggu unga ra akpenga, umɛn iwuri iwu unying ru nyaka ha ikɛi ri isok ra akpe. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ amɛnmɛn aka agbe aki arhim aka akpeke anyapuke nggu unga, ngge itsú umɛn ishimɛn ri igãrhã arhim. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Ubinkutsu ubɛn unera aba akpea, unga aka ashɔɔta ru ubok arhim.<verse eid="ROM 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Umɛn ĩba iki ikpemɛn nggu Ukiristo, umɛn iwemɛn ri imangmang ugɛ umɛn iwuri ĩbɛkmɛn nggu unga. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ aka asoyikumbɔ Ukiristo ra akpe, nggee unga asi íbvui akpea, akpe ashike ri ijee ri itsinga. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Akpe ha unga aka akpe, akpe ra arhim kishoo idiki unying, bɔr ibibɛkyɛ unga aka abɛk, abɛk ri ikpikpoi Unum.<verse eid="ROM 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Rimi hã, ra arherhe arhim, àka akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛɛ umbi aka akpembi, na akaifɛrhkɔ atsimbi ugɛ umbi awe ru urhɛ ru Unum ru ubok Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Nggee niba aneke arhim aghake iyɛrhe atsimbi, utsur ake atsu umbi adɔsumbi ikponi iyiki ibewangge. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Niba akũ agau ayormbi akorhumbi itser iyi arhim. Bɔr àka adzowe atsimbi ru Unum, ru nyaka abika adzeka akpe azĩ urhɛ, na adzowe agau atsimbi ru unga ru nyaka abin itser irhirhika. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Arhim asi íbvui aweke ateiyambi, ubinkutsu umbi asi iwembi abi Íkpem Umusa, bɔr umbi awe abi imimuta.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agãrhã ri irhirhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Umɛn igɔr ugɛ use? Azea umɛn ikorha arhim ni igɛ Íkpem ishingge ri ijee ra atsimɛn awu imimuta? Ishingge! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ugɛ umbi aba adzowe atsimbi adɔsu uwɔɔ umbi awe agãrhã uner ha? Umbi awu agãrhã ra arhim, ukpurukpi uku ikũna umbi uzĩ ra akpe, use umbi awu agãrhã ri ididɔsa, ukpurukpi uku ikũna umbi uzĩ ri irhirhika. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Bɔr itar uwɛɛ izĩ ru Unum! Umbi aka isaka awu agãrhã arhim, bɔr icɛrɛ amɛnmbi kishoo adɔsa ikpũ imesa ha umbɔ aka amesuwa umbi. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Aka ashɔɔtambɔ umbi ra arhim, umbi aka awu agãrhã irhirhika.<verse eid="ROM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Umum irherhe akɛrɛ ru nyaka anera iki irherhe ubinkutsu awu ididɔ̃rhãmbi ri ihwihwɛng. Umbi aka abayimbi idzowe atsimbi ri itser igãrhã iyi ishĩ nu ikorhu iyiki ibewe, nggee icɛrɛ àka adzowe atsimbi ugɛɛ agãrhã ri itser iyiki irhika iyiki izĩ isisar. <verse eid="ROM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Ivangyɛ umbi aka awe agãrhã arhim, amɛnmbi ashike nggu itser iyiki irhirhika. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Ugarh use umbi aka akpo ra abin hã, icɛrɛ àka awe abina atsa? Ugbɛtɛ abin hã iwu akpe! <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Bɔr icɛrɛ umbɔ aka ashɔɔta umbi ra arhimmbi, umbi awu agãrhũ Unum, ugarhkpi umbi aka akpo ukũna umbi azĩ awe asasar, nu itosambi iwu iyi urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Itosa arhim iwu akpe, bɔr izũwũ Unum iwu urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa ru ubok Ukiristo Uyesu Uteijeemɛn.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Ipfuna iwu unyaka umɛn nu ififɔrh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn umbi ahwɛngmbi íkpem. Umbi asi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ íkpem iwe ru ijee ru uner urhɛ ukpekũ? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Ru nyaku utsɛrh uwuku upfuna, ikpem ibow unga nggu utsaknga aka awe ru urhɛ, bɔr utsaka aba akpea unga aka ashɔɔta ri ikpem ipfuna. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Nggee unga aba arhaa utsa uwɔɔ ri ivangyɛ utsaknga aka awe ru urhɛ, awuri iyisa unga uner uwuku utoma-dak. Bɔr utsaka aba akpea, unga aka ashɔɔta ri ikpem hã na asi itomunga-dak uko unga abvui apfunu utsak ukuse.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Nggee, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umbi aka akpembi ri Íkpem hã, ru ubok iyor Ukiristo, ngge itsú umbi awu abi uwɔɔ, unga uwu ha umbɔ aka asoyiwe unga ra akpe, ngge itsú umɛn ighwɛr ikpũrhã ri itɔ̃we Unum itser. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Ri ivangyɛ amɛn aki arhim iki idarh umɛn, Íkpem itsu umɛn ikponi ikorha arhim. Ngge itsu umɛn ighwɛr ikpũrhã akpe. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Bɔr icɛrɛ, ru ubok akpe ru ubin hã uku ubow umɛn, umɛn iki ishɔɔrmɛn ri Íkpem ngge itsú umɛn itɔ̃ itser ru utsĩndĩ uwuku ufa ri Ipfu-Num, asi iwea utsĩndĩ uwu itsɛng ikpem iyiki igbe.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itɛ̃wã nggu arhim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Umɛn ĩgɔr ugɛ use? Íkpem iwu arhim? Ĩ'ĩ, ishingge! Umum isi íhwɛng ubinkpi uku uwe arhim Íkpem iba ishingge. Íkpem iba isi igɔrngge ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ugũo ikponu ubin unera,&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Idzi 20.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Iva 5.21</ref></char>.</note> umum isi íhwɛng ubinkpi umbɔ aki iyisa ikpona. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Bɔr arhim, akpo ivang iyiki ikũwã umum ikpona ri Íkpem, ngge ighwɛr ikpũ ikpona irhɛirhɛ ru umum. Íkpem iba ishingge arhim awu ubin uku ukpe. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Ri inum iyɔrɔ isha umum ĩbɛk ri ida ihwɛng ikpem, bɔr Íkpem iki iba, arhim asok awe ru urhɛ nu umum ikpemum. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Íkpem iki ibee ikũwã umɛn urhɛ, ngge ikũwã akpe ru umɛn.<verse eid="ROM 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Arhim ikpo ivangngge ri Íkpem irhɛm umum, ngge itsu umum ra akpe ru ubok Íkpem. <verse eid="ROM 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Nggee Íkpem iwu isarsatangge, nu itsitsungge iwu isaisar, irhika ni ize. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Ubin uku uze ukpirɛ, ukpɔ ukũwã umum akpe? Isi iwengge rimi! Bɔr awu arhim ake akũ ubin uku uze ha akũwã umum akpe. Awu Íkpem itsu umbɔ ahwɛng ubinkpi arhim aka awe. Íkpem itsu arhim idzeka iwe iki ibewe.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwa ru uner arhim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ Íkpem idzek ru Unum, bɔr umum ikpurhu iwu unergwar, agoshe umum iwu ugãrhã arhim. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Umum isi ihwɛng ubinkpi iki itsu umum ikorhe abinkɛ umum iki ikorhe. Ubinkutsu ubinkpi umum iki ibee ikikorhe, asi iwea ukpɔ umum iki ikorhe, bɔr ubinkpi umum iki ikpɛ̃, ukpɔ umum iki ikorhe. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Uba awu ubinkpi umum iki ikpɛ̃, ukpɔ umum iki ikorhe, umum ĩbemum ugɛ Íkpem ize. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, asi iwea umum ikorha ake, bɔr awu arhimkɛ aka awe ru umum. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Umum ihwɛng ugɛ ubin uku uze ushikpɔ ru umum, ru amɛn aki arhimmum. Ubinkutsu umum ibee ikorhu ubin uku uze, bɔr umum ifɔr ĩdakũ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Umum isi ikorhumum abin aka azekɛ umum iki ibee ikorhe, bɔr iyiki ibewe ha umum iki isi ĩbeemum ikorhe, ngge umum iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikorhe. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Umum ĩba ikorhu ubinkpi umum iki isi ĩbeemum ikorhe, asi iwea umum ikorhu ubin hã, awu arhimkɛ hã aka awe ru umum akorhe.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Nggee, umum inya awu idzidzɛrhe ugɛ umum inba ibee ikorhu ubin uku uze, umum inya itsimum ini ikorhu iyiki ibewe. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Ra amɛnmum, umum ĩbemumum Íkpem Unum, <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>bɔr ra agau iyormum, umum inyã ijee iyɔɔ ini itɔ̃ itser ru umum, idɛ̃ɛ̃ iwa nggu amɛnmum ni itsu umum ru ugborzĩ ijee arhim hã iki isei ra agau iyormum. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Ifakpemum iwu ubina atorh! Ungamɔ awuri ifɔrha umum ri iyor iyɛrɛ iyi akpe? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Umum itarwɛɛ ru Unum ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo Uteijeemɛn!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Nggee, umum nibikami ra amɛn aki arhimmum iwu ugãrhu Íkpem Unum, bɔr ri iyormum iwu ugãrhã ijee arhim.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ibibɛk ru ubok Ipfu-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Nggee, icɛrɛ itsu uvau akpe ri itsi abika awu ru Ukiristo Uyesu ishingge. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Ubinkutsu, iwe ru ubok Ukiristo Uyesu ijee iyi Ipfu-Num iki idzaa umbi urhɛ ni itsũwã umbi ri ijee arhim nu akpe. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Íkpem hã isi idɛ̃ɛ̃ ifɔnangge umɛn, ubinkutsu umɛn isi idɛ̃ɛ̃ idɔsumɛn Íkpem nggu amɛn aki arhimmɛn aki arhim. Bɔr Unum akorha akɛrɛ ha ri idene unanyi Ungwɛ̃nga ru usaka uner arhim. Unum atsu unga awu idɛm ru arhim, na afɛre arhim nggu iyor Ukiristo. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Ngge itsú itser irhirhika ri ikpem ikorhe itɔk ru umɛn, iki isi ibɛkmɛn iyi amɛn aki arhim bɔr iwe iyi Ipfu-Num.<verse eid="ROM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Abika abɛk ra amɛn aki arhim aki isaka atsu amɛnmbɔ ra abin iyor aki ibee, bɔr abika abɛk ri Ipfu-Num atsu amɛnmbɔ ru ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki ibee. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Amɛn uner arhim awu akpe, bɔr amɛnkɛ Ipfu-Num iki idarh awu urhɛ nu ididɔɔr. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Amɛn aki arhim awe igamtsak Unum. Asi idɔsuke Íkpem Unum, na asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhuke. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Abika abɛk ra amɛn aki arhim asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsu Unum agũã ibɛn.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Ipfu-Num iba iwengge ru umbi, asi iwea amɛn aki arhim idarh umbi bɔr awu Ipfu-Num. Ubɛn unera aka ashia ri Ipfu iyi Ukiristo, unga asi iwea uwu Ukiristo. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Bɔr Ukiristo aba awea ru umbi, ayormbi aka akpeke ru ubok arhim, rimi hã Ipfu-Num idzaa umbi urhɛ ubinkutsu unga anyanga umbi awu abika arhika. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Ipfu-Num iyiriyɛ iki isoyiwe Uyesu ra akpe iba iseingge ra amɛnmbi, unga uwu ha aka asoyiwe Ukiristo ra akpe awuri idzaanga urhɛ ra ayormbi aka akpe ru ubok Ipfunga iki isei ru umbi.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Nggee, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn iwemɛn ri itser, bɔr isi iwengge isisei iyi amɛn aki arhim. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Umbi aba abɛk ra amɛn aki arhim, umbi awuri ikpe, bɔr umbi aba abɛk ri Ipfu-Num na afɛrkumbi itser arhim iyor, umbi awuri ibɛkmbi. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Abirabɛ Ipfu-Num iki idarh umbɔ, awu angwɛ̃ Unum. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Umbi asi iyɛimbi Ipfu iyiki itsu umbi agãrhã igũ iwei ikɛi, bɔr umbi ayɛi Ipfu iyiki iwu angwɛ̃. Ru unga umɛn iki iyisu Unum ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Abba!&gt;&gt; Agbena agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Ipfu-Num ha nibikangge nggu ipfumɛn ihwɛngngge ugɛ umɛn iwu angwɛ̃ Unum. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Umɛn ĩba iwu angwɛ̃, umɛn iwu abi ukam Unum ni iwu awɛrhu ukam nggu Ukiristo. Bɔr awu ufang umɛn ĩba ihwa uver nggu unga ni idɔrhi igasha ri ikpikpoinga.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uver ukpu icɛrɛ nu ikpikpoi <optbreak/> iyi unuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Umum inyã ayetnummɛn icɛrɛ asi iweke ubin umbɔ aba akpanga ake nggu ikpikpoi iyinga aka idɛyiwa umɛn unuma. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Ímimuna kishoo ídzɛu ifosu angwɛ̃ Unum aka idzeka. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Atsu imimuna awe ibɛm, akɛrɛ asi iwea ibibema ímimuna hã, bɔr awu ubinkpi Unum aka abee ikorhe. Unga akorhe rimi ri ififosa <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>agɛ imimuna nibikangge ikpo ishishɔɔr ri igãrhãyɛ ngge iki iwe ri ivivɔ̃ɔ̃ ni itsĩ ri ififɔn nu igɔng iyi angwɛ̃ Unum.<verse eid="ROM 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ utsɛku irherɛ ímimuna kishoo idɛ̃ɛ̃ ihwihwasha ru nyaku ukutsɛrh uwuku ugũ ighong ri ivang imar. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Isi iwengge ímimuna ukpekũ ihwasha, bɔr umɛn abika akpo Ipfu-Num iyiriyɛ ngge iki iwe izũwũ Unum iyi inggbaashia. Umɛn idzɛu Unum adzipa umɛn iwe adzuma angwɛ̃nga na atsũwe ayormɛn. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Ri ifosa iyɛrɛ umbɔ aka afɔrh umɛn. Bɔr ifosayɛ umbɔ aki inyã, isi iwengge ifosa. Ungaa afosa ru ubinkpi unga aka akpoa? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Bɔr umɛn ĩba ifosa ru ubin umɛn iki inasi ikpomɛn, umɛn iwuri ĩdzɛu nggu idɔngamɛn.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Rimi hã, Ipfu-Num iki isaki iba iyika umɛn ri ididɔ̃rhãmɛn. Umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn ubinkpi umɛn iki ifɛn-Num nukpɔ, bɔr Ipfu-Num ini ifɛna Unum ru umɛn nggu ihwihwashayɛ irhɛm iki isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ isɔmngge. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Nu unga uwuku urhi amɛnmɛn ahwɛnga amɛn Ipfu-Num ha, ubinkutsu Ipfu-Num ha ifɛn-Num ra abika adɔsa nu abinkɛ unga aka afɛna awu abinkɛ Unum aka abema.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inangngge ininang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn ugɛ ra abina kishoo Unum atɔ̃ itser ayike abika abema unga, abirabɛ umbɔ aka ayisa umbɔ akpo ififɔrh. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Abirabɛ Unum aka atsũ rimɔ̃ɔ̃ awu umbɔ ha unga aka avina umbɔ anyangu uzirhzĩ Ungwɛ̃nga, ngge itsú unga awu ukã ungwɛ̃ ra arhɛrha angwɛ̃ nu anai. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Abi ha unga aka atsũ, awu umbɔ unga aka ayisa. Abi ha unga aka ayisa, awu umbɔ unga anyanga umbɔ awu abika arhika. Abi ha unga aka anyanga awe abika arhika, unga adzowe umbɔ igɔnga.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibibemu Unum ru Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Nggee umɛn ĩgɔr ugɛ use ra akɛrɛ ha? Unum aba awu nggu umɛn ungamɔ idɛ̃ɛ̃ igamtsa nggu umɛn? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Unga aka asi ikɛna Ungwɛ̃nga, bɔr adzowuka unga ru umɛn kishoo. Awu use ikɛn unga idzaa umɛn abina kishoo ikɛi izũwã? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Ungamɔ awuri itsu arherhe abirabɛ Unum aka asɛng? Awu Unum awuri itsu isheru uvau ra asunga. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Awu ungamɔ awuri itsu uvau? Unera ashia. Ukiristo Uyesu, aka akpe, unga aka asok abɛk, awu ru ubok ugha Unum, ikɛi awu unga ani ifɛnuwa umɛn! <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Ungamɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ agau umɛn nggu ibibema Ukiristo? Awu ayetnum, use itsũwã, use uver, use imerh, use igbĩrhĩ, use ubin uku utsu iwei, use akpe? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Ru ungo umɛn inyã akpe ubɛn unum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">anyanga umɛn ru nyaka ídɔi umbɔ aka ingwã.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Amb 44.22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Ĩ'ĩ, ra abina akɛrɛ kishoo, umɛn itɔngmɛn ininang ru uboknga aka abema umɛn. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Ubinkutsu umum ihwɛng ugɛ uko akpe use urhɛ, use ípfu itser-Num use ípfu iyiki ibewe, use icɛrɛ, use unuma, use ikpũ ijee iyɔɔ, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>use ider use ighor, use ubin ukpɔɔ ra abinkɛ umbɔ aka amuna kishoo, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ agauke umɛn nggu ibibemu Unum aka akorhuwa umɛn ru ubok Ukiristo Uyesu Uteijeemɛn.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Unum nggu anernga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Umum irherhe idzidzɛrhe ru Ukiristo isi igbɛrmum angwĩ, amɛnmum adɛyiwake umum ru ubok Ipfu Isarsatangge. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Umum iwe ru nggaa idamɛn nu igũ ighong ra amɛnmum aka asi ímaake. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Ngge iba imɛ̃ɛ̃ngge, umum ibee umbɔ atsuka umum ikponum na agau umum nggu Ukiristo ri ifɔrh angwɛ̃mɛn, aner unangmum, <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>aner Uisrairha. Unum asɛng umbɔ awe angwɛ̃nga. Unga adɛyiwe umbɔ igɔngnga na adzowe umbɔ ibibemuwenga. Umbɔ ayɛi Ikpem, umbɔ adzowe igɔng ri Iya-Num, nu ayɛi ibibemuwenga. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Uibrahim, Uishaku, nu Uyakubu awu atokambɔ ri iyor, Ukiristo iganga awu unang Uisrairha. Ukiristo awu Unum uwu abina kishoo, na awe ri idorh ugbagbaa! Iwerimi.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Isi iwengge ugɛ ibibemuwe-Num nggu anera iki igba, asi iwea anang Uisrairha kishoo awe aner Unum. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Ikɛi asi iwea anang Uibrahim kishoo awe ungwɛ̃ Uibrahim. Unum agɔr Uibrahim agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ru Uishaku ukpekũ ungo iki ikpo unang hã umum iki inbemuwa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Ing 21.12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Agben akɛrɛ agɛ asi iwea angwɛ̃ abirabɛ Uibrahim aka amar ri iyor awu angwɛ̃ Unum, awu angwɛ̃ ibibemuwe ukpekũ awe angwɛ̃ Uibrahim. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Ibibemuwe ha irherhe riminɛ, igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ri ivang iyɛrɛ ra amɛk aka aba, umum ibvui ĩbamum, Usaratu awuri imar ungwɛ̃.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Ing 18.10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 18:14">14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Asi iwea ake ukpekũ, bɔr angwɛ̃ Urifkatu utesmbɔ awu unying, utɛmɛn Uishaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12"/>Unga anasi imara akãrhghwɛ̃ awɛkaci ha, use umbɔ atɔ̃mbɔ itser iyiki ize use iyiki ibewe, Unum adɛyiwe Urifkatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwuku ukũa awuri itɔ̃we itser ru uwuku ucia.&gt;&gt; Akɛrɛ adɛyiwa ugɛ Unum ani isɛng abirabɛ unga aka abee, isi iwengge ru ubok itsermbɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.11-12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Ing 25.23</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ibemu Uyakubu, ni ikpɛ̃mum Isuwa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Umrh 1.2</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 1:3">3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Umɛn iwuri igɔr ugɛ use? Unum asi irhikunga nukpɔ? Ishingge! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Unga agɔr Umusa agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri igũ atorh unerwi umum iki igũ atorh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">ni icorhuwe uwuruwi umum iki icorhuwe.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Idzi 33.19</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Nggee, awu Unum unga ani igũ atorh, asi iwea itser unera use ititɛ̃wãnga. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr Ufir'auna igɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum itsu ungo uwu uyɛrhe, ru umum ikũ ungo idɛyiwe ijeemum ni isɔme itsokmum ru upfunga kishoo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Idzi 9.16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Nggee, Unum awuri igũ atorh unerwi unga aka abee igũ atorh, ikɛi abvure amɛn uwuruwi unga aka ibvure.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Avɔm Unum nu imimutanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Bɔr uwɔɔ ru umbi awuri igɔr umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu Unum anyã avaumɛn? Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ akpɛ̃ ubinkpi unga aka abee?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Bɔr ungo uwu ungamɔ, unera, ungo iki iwe ru uning nggu Unum? Ubinkpi umbɔ aka akũ abĩ adzin usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ugɔrkpɔ uwuku udzin ukpɔ ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu ungo udzin umum rimi?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Uish 29.16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45.9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Uner uwuku udzin anũi abĩ, asi iwea ri ijee iyiki ikũ abĩ hã akorhu ubinkpi unga aka abee? Unga awea ri ijee iyiki idzin anũi iyi itser ugarh use iyi itser iyiki isheru ugarh.<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Rimi hã awu idzidzɛrhe Unum aka akorhe. Unga aka abee idɛyiwe avɔmnga, ikɛi adɛyiwe ijeenga. Bɔr unga adɔngamɛn nggu abirabɛ avɔmnga aka imɛ̃ igba ru umbɔ ni itsĩme umbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Unga akorha akɛrɛ ha ri idɛyiwe ikpikpoinga ra abirabɛ unga aka agũ atorh, abirabɛ unga aka asɛng ri idɛyiwe ikpikpoinga ishaisha. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Uko umɛn, unga aka ayisa, asi iwea ra abi Uyahuda ukpekũ bɔr nggu atsen abi Uyahuda ikɛi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Ru nyaka unga aka arherhe ru ubvur Uhosiya agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Umbɔ asi iwembɔ anermum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">bɔr umum iwuri iyisa umbɔ anermum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">ikɛi asi iwea uwu umum iki ibema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">bɔr umum iyisa unga uwu umum iki ibema.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Uho 2.23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Na agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">&lt;&lt;Ngge iwuri ikorhungge uku kpengkpeng ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka agɔr umbɔ agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">&lt;Umbi asi iwembi anermum,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">awuri iyisa umbɔ &lt;angwɛ̃ Unum uwu urhɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Uho 1.10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Uishaya adũwũ udũwã ri itsi abi Uisrairha agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">&lt;&lt;Uko irhɛ abi Uisrairha iwe ru nyaku uzuzeu azɛ̃ akagɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">abika abɔr ukpekũ awuri ikpo ififɔrh.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Uteijee awuri itsu ufainga ru upfung iki ifefetem idiki unying.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 10:22">Uish 10.22</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:23">23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Ru nyaku Uishaya aka arherhe agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">&lt;&lt;Agɛ Uteijee uner ijee kishoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">asi inekanga umɛn anang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">umɛn iwuri iwe ru nyaka Usɔdɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">umɛn iwuri iwe ru nyaku Ugomora.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Uish 1.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ida imangmang abi Uisrairha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Ude umɛn igɔr ugɛ use? Ugɛ atsen abi Uyahuda aka asi ibeembɔ irhirhika, aka akpombɔ ngge, irhirhikayɛ iki iwe ri imangmang. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Abi Uisrairha aka atɛ̃wã abee Unum anyanga umbɔ awu abika arhika ri idɔsi Íkpem, bɔr asi ikpombɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Awu use ikɛn? Ubinkutsu, umbɔ asi ibeembɔ ngge ri imangmang bɔr umbɔ abeea ngge ri itser. Umɔ umbɔ adana nu &lt;&lt;utarh ukpuku ukwɛr itok.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;Unyã, umum iden utarh ru Usihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ukpuku itsu anera adani itok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">nu ifa iyiki itsu anera agbeigba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">bɔr ubɛn uwuruwi aka awe ru imangmang ru unga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">asi íhwaa atsak.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Uish 8.14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:16">28.16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ubinkpi amɛnmum aka abee nu ifɛn-Nummum iwu ugɛ abi Uisrairha ama akpo ififɔrh. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Umum iwemum ri ideka ri itsimbɔ ugɛ adzowukumbɔ amɛnmbɔ ru Unum, bɔr idzowe amɛnmbɔ isi iwengge ri ihwihwɛng. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ irhirhikayɛ iki idzek ru Unum, nggee umbɔ abee itsu atsimbɔ awe abika arhika na asi ineke Unum atsu umbɔ awe abika arhika. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Ukiristo awe imimasha Íkpem ngge itsú ubɛn unerwi aka awe ri imangmang ama awe uwuku usheru uvau.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ififɔrh iwu iyi ubɛn unera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Umusa atsɛng riminɛ irhirhika iki ikpo ri idɔsi Íkpem, agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner uwuku udɔsi ikpem iyɛrɛ awuri ibɛka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Urha 18.5</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Bɔr irhirhika iki iwe ri imangmang igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ugɔrɔ ra amɛnngo ugɛ, &lt;Ungamɔ awuri ifũ ra afã akũ Ukiristo acipuwa?&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:13">Iva 30.13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Use &lt;Ungamɔ awuri itsĩ ra anang abika akpe asoyiwe Ukiristo ra akpe?&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:13">Iva 30.13</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Irhirhika ha igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:8">&lt;&lt;Urhɛm hã akhapa ru ungo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:8">uwe ra angwĩngo nu ra amɛnngo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:14">Iva 30.14</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:8">Ake awe, arherhe imangmang umɛn iki ĩdũwã ake. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Ungo uba urherhungo nggu angwĩngo ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyesu awu Uteijee,&gt;&gt; nu uweɔ ri imangmang ra amɛnngo ugɛ Unum asoyiwe unga ra akpe, ungo uwuri ikpoɔ ififɔrh. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Ubinkutsu idzowe imangmang nggu amɛnngo ngge itsú ungo ushiɔ ru uvau ra asu Unum, nu ukũ angwĩngo urherhe ngge itsú ungo ukpo ififɔrh. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera aka awe ru imangmang ru unga asi ígũa atsak.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Uish 28.16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Ubinkutsu umɛn iwe ubina unying, uwɔɔ asi inanga uwɔɔ, abi Uyahuda nu atsen abi Uyahuda awu unying. Uteijee ha awe Uteijee anera kishoo na atsuke idorh ru kishoo uwuku ufɛna unga. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unerwi aka ayisi itsok Uteijee awuri ikpoa ififɔrh.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Uyow 2.32</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Bɔr anera akorhu uguse na ayisu Unum umbɔ aba ashimbɔ ri imangmang ru unga? Awuri ikorha aguse na awe ru imangmang ru uwuruwi umbɔ aba anasi igũmbɔ isarhe ri itsinga? Awuri ikorha aguse na agũ, unera aba asi idzowuka umbɔ isarhe? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Awuri ikorha aguse na adzowe isarhe, umbɔ aba asi idenukumbɔ umbɔ? Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Adak abika akũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize awu azezerake!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Uish 52.7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Bɔr asi iwea kishoo abi Uisrairha aka ayɛi Isarhe Iyiki Ize ha. Ubinkutsu Uishaya arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungamɔ awe ru imangmang ri isarhamɛn?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Uish 53.1</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Nggee imangmang idzek ri igũ isarhe, igũ isarhe ri itsi Ukiristo. <verse eid="ROM 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Bɔr umum irhusa, abi Uisrairha anasi igũmbɔ? Aka agũmbɔ, itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt;Irhak arherhambɔ iki idɔsu abĩã kishoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">írhɛmmbɔ iki itsĩngge ru upfunga kishoo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Amb 19.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Ikɛi umum ibvui irhusa, abi Uisrairha asi ihwɛngmbɔ? Ĩĩ, ahwɛngmbɔ, uko ri inggbaashia, Umusa agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri itsu umbi agũ unyɛ̃ɛ̃ abirabɛ umbi aka asi inyanga umbɔ awembɔ ubin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">umum iwuri itsu umbi agũ avɔm ru ubok abirabɛ aka ashimbɔ ri ihwihwɛngmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Iva 32.21</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Nu Uishaya arherhe nggu ikeramɛn agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Abirabɛ aka asi ibeembɔ umum, akpo umum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">umum idzeka ra abirabɛ aka asi ibeembɔ umum.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Uish 65.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Bɔr ri itsi abi Uisrairha, unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">&lt;&lt;Kishoo unuma umum ibera abokmum iyɛi anera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">abika asheri ididɔsa nu abika akpɛ̃ igigũ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Uish 65.2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Unum asi ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ Uisrairha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Nggee umum irhusa, Unum aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ anernga? Ishingge! Umum iwe uner Uisrairha, umum idzeku unang Uibrahim ru unui Ubanjami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Unum asi ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ abirabɛ unga aka asɛng ri inggbaashia. Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ubinkpi itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki irherhe ri itsi Uirhiya? Unga aka akũ akpenga azĩ ru Unum ri itsi Uisrairha. Agɛ, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>&lt;&lt;A Uteijee, aka afɛrkumbɔ abika asɔm Arherhu-Numngo, na asipukumbɔ abeungo, awu umum ĩbɔr ikiyikami, ikɛi umbɔ abee ifɛre umum?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1Ayɛ 19.10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Unum adzipuwe unga aguse? Adzipa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ibɔre anera anaka agɔnga utɔɔva aka anasi itar arhu na adzowukumbɔ igɔng ru unum uwu Uba'arh.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1Ayɛ 19.18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Nggee ikɛi, icɛrɛ, anerabɛ Unum aka asɛng ri imimutanga ana abɔrmbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Isisɛng hã iwe ri imimuta, asi iwea ri itseryɛ anera aka atɔ̃. Iba isi iwengge rimi, imimuta ha isi iwengge imimuta.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Awu use ucɛ? Abi Uisrairha afɔr ikpo ubin umbɔ aka abee adambɔ, bɔr abirabɛ Unum aka asɛng akpombɔ. Bɔr abika abɔr awu abi atsi aka aker. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">&lt;&lt;Unum atsu umbɔ arharhɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">Unga adzowe umbɔ asu aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ anyãke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">nu ato aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ agũke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">uba utsĩ irherɛ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Iva 29.4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Uish 29.10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Nu Udauda agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;&lt;Uneke irhowambɔ iwu unggurhi ru umbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">ubinkpi uku itsu umbɔ agbaigba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">Uneke umgbɔ utsu umbɔ ufai.<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Uneke asumbɔ awu uzĩ utsur umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ anyãmbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">andzingmbɔ apfuri ugbagbaa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Amb 69.22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:23">23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ififɔrh atsen abi Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Ikɛi umum irhusa, abi Uisrairha aka akwɛr itok agbaigba asi ísombɔ nukpɔ? Ishingge! Ubinkutsu igbigbambɔ ngge itsú ififɔrh iba ra atsen abi Uyahuda ngge itsú abi Uisrairha agũ unyɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Uba uvaumbɔ ukowe upfunga iwe ru ubin, ikɛi uba igbigbambɔ ikowe iwe ru ubin ra atsen abi Uyahuda, iwe ru ubin hã iwe igusengge ri ivangyɛ abi Uisrairha arhɛrhɛ aka idzipa adɔsu Unum!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Umum ini irherhe nggu umbi atsen abi Uyahuda. Unum aka atsũ umum iwe uner itser Uyesu ra atsen abi Uyahuda, umum ifĩrhã ri itsermum, <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>ni ifosa ugɛ umum ima itsu anermum abi Uisrairha agũ unyɛ̃ɛ̃ ni ifɔrhe abɔɔ ru umbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Ikpikpɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ iba idzowe ififɔrh ru upfung, iyiyɛimbɔ iwuri iwe iguse? Iwuri idzowe urhɛ ra abika akpukpe! <verse eid="ROM 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Uba uteng akɔ̃ uborodi umbɔ aka adzowe idɛm ru Unum awe asasar, akɔ̃ hã kishoo awe asasar nukpɔ. Ikɛi anunang ucucii aba uwe asasar, abok ucucii ha kishoo awe asasar nukpɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Bɔr abok akɔɔ aki ucucii uzaitun ha aka abvũĩke, na anyanga ubok aki arhum agbopuwe. Umbi atsen abi Uyahuda, umbi awu ru nyaka abok ucucii arhum, umbɔ aka akũ agbopa nggu ucucii ha. Icɛrɛ umbi aka akpo igha atsei ra anũnang uzaitun ha. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Niba anyangu atsimbi anangmbi abok ucucii akɔɔ. Umbi aba akorhumbi, àka ayita ugɛ asi iwea umbi iyike anunang hã, bɔr awu anunang hã ayika umbi. <verse eid="ROM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Bɔr umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ agɔrmbi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aboka abvũĩ umbɔ akpo utsĩndĩ uwuku ugbopa umum nggu ucucii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Iwe idzidzɛrhe! Bɔr ida imangmang ngge itsu umbɔ abvũĩwe umbɔ ru ucucii, ungo igango awu imangmang ngge itsu ungo udɛ̃ɛ̃. Niba ufĩrhungo, ugũ iwei Unum. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Unum aba abvũĩka undzumu abok ucucii ha, unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ abvũĩka ungo igango uba unga abeenga.<verse eid="ROM 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Àka anyã atorh Unum, ikɛi anyã uvernga ra abika agbugba. Awu ru uver ra abika agbugba, bɔr agũã atorhngo, ungo uba uzɛ̃rhũngo ru atorhnga. Bɔr ungo uba ushiɔ, awuri izharha ungo atare. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Uba abi Uisrairha asi izɛ̃rhũmbɔ ri ida imangmang, awuri igbopukumbɔ umbɔ nggu ucucii ha, ubinkutsu Unum adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzipa umbɔ atsukuka. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Umbi atsen abi Uyahuda awe ru nyaka abok ucucii uzaitun aki arhum, umbɔ aka agbɛr agbopuwe ake itsɛrh nggu ucucii uzaitun akirakɛ umbɔ aka akau. Akɛrɛ aba awu idzidzɛrhe, asi íghonga ru Unum aka ibvui adzipa abok ucucii ha umbɔ aka agbɛr, agbopa nggu ucucii ha umbɔ aka agbɛr ake!<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi Uisrairha kishoo <optbreak/> awuri ikpombɔ ififɔrh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Umum isi ĩbeemum umbi asei ri ida ihwɛng abinkɛ umbɔ aka awɔk, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, utsur umbi awembi abika abera atsi. Abi Uisrairha adɛ̃ɛ̃ iker itsi utsɛku Unum aka isɛng atsen abi Uyahuda awe ru imangmang ru unga. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Nggee kishoo abi Uisrairha awuri ikpombɔ ififɔrh, ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Uwuku ufɔrh awuri idzeku Usihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">unga awuri itsũwe kishoo ikpɛ̃ idɔsu Unum ra amɛn Uyakubu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Akɛrɛ ake awu ibibemuwemum ru umbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">ivangyɛ umum iki itsũwe arhimmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Uish 59.20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:9">27.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Uiri 31.33</ref>,<ref loc="JER 31:34">34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Abi Uisrairha awu anggamtsak ru Isarhe Iyiki Ize, ru ugarha uwu ukpumbi, umbi atsen abi Uyahuda. Rimi hã umbɔ ana awu anernga aka abema ubinkutsu atsɛng atokambɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Ubinkutsu, Unum asi íyesuka izũwãyɛ unga aka adzowe use atsɛyi abirabɛ unga aka atsũ. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Umbi aka asi iwembi abika adɔsu Unum, bɔr icɛrɛ umbi aka ayɛi icicorhe ri itsi ida ididɔsambɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Rimi hã, umbɔ awe abika asheri ididɔsa ngge itsú umbɔ ayɛi icicorhe ubinkutsu Unum aka adzaanga umbi icicorhe. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Ida ididɔsa anera kishoo itsu Unum akorhuwe umbɔ ru nyaka abi ugbor uzĩ, ngge itsú unga ama acorhuwe umbɔ kishoo.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikpikpoi ru Unum</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ amei iwe ru ubin Unum nu itsoi nu ihwihwɛngnga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ ahwɛng abinkɛ unga aka abee ikorhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">use adɛ̃ɛ̃ adɛyiwe abinkɛ unga iki ikorhe?<verse eid="ROM 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>&lt;&lt;Ungamɔ ahwɛng ifɛrhkɔ Uteijee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Use adzowe unga itsũwã?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Uish 40.13</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Ungamɔ aka adzowe ru Unum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">ngge itsú Unum afase unga?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Uay 41.11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Kishoo abin adzeku Uteijee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Abina kishoo amuna ru uboknga na awuri ibvui azĩ ru unga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Ikpikpoi iwe iyinga ugbagbaa! Iwerimi.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Idɛm-Num iyi urhɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Nggee, umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ri icicorhe iyi Unum, àka adzowe atsimbi ru nyaki idɛm-Num iyi urhɛ, iyiriyɛ iki iwu isaisar ni iwu ubin uku ububema ru Unum. Akɛrɛ ha awu idzowe igɔngmbi iyi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Niba abeembi ifɛrhkɔ iyi undan ukpirɛ idarhngge amɛnmbi, bɔr àka aneke Unum afaruwe umbi awe abika afa ra amɛnmbi. Mɔcɛ umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ ahwɛngmbi abinkɛ Unum aka abema, ake awe aka aze akika abubema nu akika arhurhika.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Ubinkutsu imimutayɛ umbɔ aka adzaa umum, umum igɔr ubɛn unera ru umbi, inggɛ niba anyãngumbi atsimbi anangke iwiwembi, bɔr aka anyanga atsimbi uku kpengkpeng, ri imangmangyɛ Unum aka adzaa umbi. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Umɛn iwe ra agau arhɛrhɛ ri iyora unying, kishoo agau ha awe ru itserke aweke, <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Rimi hã ru Ukiristo, umɛn iwe arhɛrhɛ, umɛn iwe iyora unying, ubɛn unera ru umɛn awu ugau udɔka. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Izũwãyɛ umbɔ aka adzaa umɛn iwiwengge, ru nyaki imimutayɛ umbɔ aka adzaa umɛn. Izũwũ unera iba iwu iyiki isɔm Arherhu-Num, neke unga atɔ̃ itsernga uku kpengkpeng nggu imangmangnga. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Iba iwu iyiki itɔ̃ itser, neke unga atɔ̃ itser. Ngge iba iwu iyiki imesuwe, neke unga amesuwe. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Ngge iba iwu iyiki ifituwe, neke unga afituwe. Ngge iba iwu iyiki idzowe izũwã ra adɔka, neke unga ayanga aboknga adzowe. Ngge iba iwu iyiki ikpɔm anera, neke unga atsu amɛnnga. Ngge iba iwu iyiki igũ atorh, uneke unga agũ atorh anera nu itɛnamɛn.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibibema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Awu ufang ibibema iwu iyi idzidzɛrhe. Àka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ ubin uku ubewe, bɔr àka akpɔm ubin uku uze. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Àka adzowe atsimbi ra adɔka ri ibibema. Àka adzowe imor ra adɔka anangmbi atsimbi. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Niba aghɛrhumbi ighɛrha, bɔr àka atsu amɛnmbi akarhãrhã atɔ̃ itser Uteijee. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Àka agɔm anggɔm ri ifosa, àka abima ra ayetnummbi, àka afɛn-Num ubɛn ivang. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Àka agasha abinmbi nggu abika adɔsa abika abubee. Àka ayɛi atsen nggu aboka avaa.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Àka atsuke idorh ra abika ayɔm umbi, àka atsuke umbɔ idorh, niba atsukukumbi umbɔ ikpo Unum. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Àka agɔm anggɔm nggu abika agɔm anggɔm, àka aciu akpe nggu abika aciu akpe. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Àka asei uku ughwɔɔw nggu adɔka. Niba aberumbi itsi, àka awe awɛrhɛ atsũwã. Niba anyanga atsimbi awembi abi isarasu anangmbi abɔɔ.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Niba afaimbi iki ibewe nggu iki ibewe ru ubɛn unera. Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn na akorhe ubin uku urhika ra asu anera. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Iba imɛ̃ngge, àka abee isei uku ughwɔɔw nggu ubɛn unera. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Umbi awɛrhamum, àka niba afaimbi, àka aneke Unum afai ra avɔmnga, ubinkutsu ri itsɛng Arherhu-Num Uteijee agɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ififai iwu iyimum, umum iwuri ifai.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Iva 32.35</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num ikɛi igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">&lt;&lt;Unggamtsakngo aba agũã imerh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">ungo udzowe unga ubingha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">unga aba agũã ugɔ̃ amɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">ungo udzowe unga ubin unga ahwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Ikorhe rimi, ungo uwuri ipfumuwe unga akãã urha ni itsinga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Uny 25.21</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:22">22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Niba uneke iki ibewe inangge atsimbi, bɔr àka anang iki ibewe nggu iki ize.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Idɔsa abi ijee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Awu ufang ubɛn unera adɔsa arherhe abi ijee, ubinkutsu awu Unum angwɛ̃ ijee kishoo. Ijeeyɛ iki iwe, awu Unum angwɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Ngge itsu, uwuruwi aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ idɔsa arherhe iyɛrhe, akpɛ̃ idɔsa abin Unum aka atsu, abika akorhe rimi akowe uvau ra atsimbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Ubinkutsu ayɛrhe asi iwembɔ ubin iwei ra abirabɛ aki ikorhe uku urhirhiki, bɔr abika awu ru uvau. Ungo ubeengo neke igũ iwei abi ijee? Ukorhu ubinkpi uku urhika, umbɔ awuri ikpoi ungo. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Umbɔ awu ugãrhũ Unum uwuku ukorhuwa ungo iyiki ize. Bɔr ungo uba uwu uner uvau, ugũ iwei, asi iwea ibɛm umbɔ aka akpɔm ikon iki ider. Umbɔ awu agãrhã Unum, awu ru ubokmbɔ avɔm Unum aka atsuafɛr, akowe ufai ru uner uvau. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Nggee, azea umbi adɔsa abi ijee, asi iwea itĩ avɔm Unum ukpekũ, bɔr ri ifɛrhkɔmbi ishingge ru uvau.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu umbi afai ikirbi abĩ, abi ijee awe agãrhã Unum, aka adzowe undzumu ivangmbɔ ri itser iyɛrhe. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Àka afase ubɛn unera uvɛrhnga. Ngge iba iwu uvɛrh ikirbi abĩ, àka afai ikirbi abĩ. Ngge iba iwu uvɛrh abinkɛ umbi aka abemi idzowe, àka adzowe. Ngge iba iwu idzowe imor, àka adzowe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibibema, unuma uku uyokpɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Niba angwɛ̃mbi uvɛrh unera, bɔr uvɛrh ibibema ukpekũ, ukpɔ uwe uvɛrhkpi umbi aka asi ífai amaambi, ubinkutsu, uwuku ubemu undɔkanga adɔsi Íkpem. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Ikpem hã iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba utomungo-dak, niba ufɛrɔ unera, niba uvɛpɔ ivɛu, niba ugũo unyɛ̃ɛ̃ ubin unera,&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-15">Idzi 20.13-15</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Iva 5.17-19</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:21">21</ref></char>.</note> nu ikpem iyɔɔ iki iwe. Ngge itsuifɛr ri ikpem iyɛrɛ iyiki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubemu udɔkango ru nyaka ungo uku ubemu itsingo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Urha 19.18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Uba ungo ubemungo adɔka, ungo usi ítsu umbɔ agbambɔ. Nggee ibibema itsuifɛr Íkpem.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Awu ufang umbi akorha akɛrɛ ha, umbi ahwɛngmbi ivanga iki iwengge umbi aka izir ru urhɔ. Ubinkutsu ivang iyiki ifɔrh umɛn iki iyo inangge ivangyɛ umɛn iki inggbaashia iwe ru imangmang. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Utsuu uku uwuri imaakpɔ, unum ukpuku ufɔrh uku abɔr ukunjiir ru ukpee usar. Nggee àka atsimuwe itser uzĩmbi ru nyaka atorha arhim, na atsim abin iwa aki irhirhang. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Umɛn ikorha abin aka arhika, ru nyaka abika asei ri irhirhang unum, asi iwea abika ahwesha abin use abin arhim akɔɔ, asi iwea abi afĩrhã, use iyiki itãrhã ibee igũibɛn iyiki ishera atsa, use ifuw nu unyɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, àka atsim Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo ugɛɛ atorho aka afa, àka niba awembi ra amɛn aki arhim aka idarh umbi ri ikponangge.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Idzin adɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Àka ayɛi unerwi imangmangnga iki isi ikerngge, niba awembi ru uning nggu unga ri itsi ubinkpi unga aki ikaifɛrhkɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Imangmang uner uwɔɔ ibemuwe unga agha abina kishoo, bɔr uner uwɔɔ imangmangnga iki isi ikerngge, agha ayerhe ukpekũ. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Unerwi aka agha abina kishoo awu ufang unga niba ayɛɛinga uwuruwi aka asi ighaa, nu unerwi aka asi ighaa abina kishoo awu ufang unga niba akwɛɛrka uwuku ugha abina kishoo, ubinkutsu Unum aka ayɛisa unga. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Ungo ugburh ungamɔ ungo uku itsu uvau ru ugãrhũ uner uwɔɔ? Uteiyanga awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ atsu unga agba use atsu unga anang. Nggayɛ Uteijee awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ atsu unga ananga.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Uner uwɔɔ aka isaka anyã unum ukpɔɔ unangkpɔ inum iyɔɔ, inyĩnyã uwɔɔ inuma kishoo iwu ubina unying ru unga. Ubɛn unera adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ru ubinkpi unga aka ahwɛng. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Unga uwuku unyã unum ukpɔɔ uwu undzuma ru unga, akorhe ri imor Uteijee. Unga uwuku utãi ijuɛ, atãi ri imor Uteijee, ubinkutsu unga atar uwɛɛ ru Unum, nu uwuku ugha ubɛn ubin, akorhe ri imor Uteijee na atar uwɛɛ ru Unum. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ abɛka ri iyike itsinga ukpekũ, ikɛi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akpea ri iyike itsinga ukpekũ. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Uba umɛn ibibɛk, umɛn ibɛk ri idzowe imor ru Uteijee, umɛn ĩba ikpikpe, umɛn ikpe ri idzowe imor ru Uteijee ha. Nggee, umɛn ĩba ibibɛk use akpe, umɛn iwu abi Uteijee ha.<verse eid="ROM 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu Ukiristo akpe na abvui awu ru urhɛ, ngge itsú unga awu Uteijee abika akpukpe nu abika abubɛk. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Ungo, mɔcɛ, awu use utsu ungo utsu uvau ru ungwɛ̃mbi use unapumbi? Awu use utsu ungo ukwɛɛte ungwɛ̃mbi use unapumbi? Ubinkutsu kishoo umɛn iwuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra anang isei Unum uwuku uvarhuwa arherhamɛn. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Ri itsɛng Arherhu-Num Uteijee agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Umum iyirh nggu ibibɛkmum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">ubɛn utsurhu uwuri irhupa ra asumum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">ubɛn arhɛm awuri irherhukpɔ ru Unum.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Uish 45.23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Nggee, ubɛn unera ru umɛn awuri ivarhunga irhɛ abinkɛ unga aka akorhe ri ibibɛknga ra asu Unum.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Niba utsukɔ ungwɛ̃mbi ubin ikwɛr itok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Nggee umɛn ineke itsu avau ra adɔka. Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, ubɛn unera atsu amɛnnga niba awea utarh ukpuku ukwɛr itok use ubin ukpɔɔ uku uvina ru utsĩndĩ ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Umum ihwɛng ugɛ ru Uteijee Uyesu ubingha ushikpɔ ukpuku usi isarkpɔ. Bɔr unera aba agɔr ugɛ ubin ukpɔɔ usi isarkpɔ, iwe ru unga ubin hã uku usi isarkpɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Ungo uba udakuwe amɛn angwɛ̃mbi ru ubinkpi ungo iki igha, ungo usi ikorhungo amɛn ibibema. Utsur ubinghakpi ungo iki igha udakuwe ungwɛ̃mbi use unapumbi uwuruwi Ukiristo aka akpe ru unga. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Niba uneke ubin uku uze ri inyinyãngo, umbɔ anyã ukpɔ uwe iki ubewe. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Iyɛrhe Unum isi iwengge ighigha nu ihwihwa, bɔr iwu irhirhika, nu ididɔɔr, nu igũibɛn ri Ipfu Isarsatangge. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Ubinkutsu ubɛn unera uwuku utɔ̃itser Ukiristo ru utsĩndĩ uwurɛ, Unum nu anera awuri ibemumbɔ unga.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Nggee umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ iker ri ikorha abinkɛ aka ikũwã ididɔɔr ni ifita adɔka. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Niba adakukumbi itser Unum ra arherhe abingha. Abingha kishoo awu asarsatake, bɔr asi izea unera agha ubin uku itsu ikwɛr itok ru uwɔɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Azea ungo niba utãingo ijuɛ, use uhwaɔ adɛ use ukorhe abina akɔɔ aka itsu ungwɛ̃mbi use unapumbi agbaigba.<verse eid="ROM 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Nggee ungo uba uweɔ ri imangmang ra akɛrɛ ha, ungo ungwɛ̃ ake ra amɛnngo nggu Unum. Idorh iwu iyi uner ha amɛnnga aka asi itsuke uvau ri itsinga. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Bɔr unerwi aka acang, aba aghaa ubin hã unga aka acang, unga aka agba uvau nukpɔ. Ubinkutsu ighighanga ishingge ri imangmang, nu ubɛn ubinkpi uku ushikpɔ ri imangmang uwu arhim.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Uneke ungwɛ̃mbi agũibɛn ungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Umɛn abika aker ri imangmang, imɛ̃ngge umɛn itsã imor abirabɛ aka asi ikermbɔ, ni ineke igũibɛn atsimɛn. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Ubɛn unera ru umɛn atɛne amɛn udɔka ru iyiki izeyɛ iki idzin unga. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Ukiristo asi ikorhunga abin itsinga, bɔr ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Urhena ukpu abika arhena ungo ugba ri itsimum.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Amb 69.9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Ubɛn ubinkpi umbɔ aka atsɛng isha, atsɛng ru ake amesuwa umɛn, ngge idarh umɛn ru ibibima nu ififita itsɛng Arherhu-Num umɛn ima iwe ru ifosa.<verse eid="ROM 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Neke Unum uwuku udzowe ibibima nu ififita adzaa umbi amɛn aka agbopi itsi nggu adɔkambi ri idɔsu Ukiristo Uyesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>ngge itsú umbi ama akpoi Unum nu Utɛ Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo nggu amɛn unying nu angwĩmbi unying.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Àka ayɛi adɔka, ru nyaku Ukiristo aka ayɛi umbi, nu umbi atsu ikpikpoi ru Unum. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi ugɛ Ukiristo awu uner itser ra abi Uyahuda ngge idɛyiwa ugɛ Unum awuri ikorhunga ubinkpi unga aka arherhe, na akorhunga ibibemuwe unga aka abemuwe atokambɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Ngge itsu atsen abi Uyahuda akpoi Unum ra atorhnga, ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri ikpoi ungo ra ateu atsen abi Uyahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">umum iwuri itsusa abom ru itsokngo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2Usm 22.50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Amb 18.49</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Ikɛi, ngge igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;Àka agũibɛn umbi atsen abi Uyahuda, nggu anernga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Iva 32.43</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Ikɛi igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">&lt;&lt;Àka akpoi Uteijee ha, kishoo umbi atsen abi Uyahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">na atsusa abom ru unga, kishoo umbi anera.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Amb 117.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Ikɛi Uishaya agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">&lt;&lt;Unang Ujesse uwuri ikũ udzeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">uwɔɔ aka iso agha iyɛrhe abĩã kishoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">atsen abi Uyahuda awuri ifosa ru unga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Uish 11.10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Unum uwu ifosa ama atsuka umbi igũibɛn kishoo nu ididɔɔr ri imangmangmbi ru unga, ngge itsú umbi awe ru afosa irhɛirhɛ ri ijee Ipfu Isarsatangge.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itser Uburhu ra atsen abi Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Umum nibikami ĩbemumum ugɛ umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umbi awembi ra amɛn aka aze akarhãrhã. Umbi adzuma awembi ri ihwihwɛng na adɛ̃ɛ̃ amesukumbi adɔka. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Umum iki itsɛngamum umbi ra awiya nu abina akɔɔ, umum iyituwa ake ru umbi ikɛi. Umum ikorha akɛrɛ ubinkutsu Unum adzaa umum imimuta <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>ngge itsú umum iwe uner itser Ukiristo Uyesu ra atsen abi Uyahuda. Umum itɔ̃ itser iyi uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num ri idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Unum, ngge itsú atsen abi Uyahuda awe idɛm-Num iyi Unum aka ayɛi, iyiriyɛ Ipfu Isarsatangge iki itsu ngge isar.<verse eid="ROM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Nggee umum ikpoi itsermum iyi Unum ubinkutsu umum itɔ̃we ngge ru Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Umum idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikeramɛn irherhumum ubin ru ubinkpi Ukiristo ukpekũ aka akũ umum akorhe ri idarh atsen abi Uyahuda umbɔ adɔsu Unum ra arherhamum nu ikikorhe, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>ri ijee atsar nu abin idzeu, ri ijee Ipfu-Num. Ngge udzur ru Urusharhima umum iki ikɔre izĩ Uirhirikum, umum iki idũwũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize ha iyi Ukiristo. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Ibibemamum niyɔ umum idũwũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka asi ihwɛngmbɔ Ukiristo, utsur umum idzinmum ni itsi anangkɛ uwɔɔ aka atsu atarh idzin. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, ru nyaki itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;Abirabɛ umbɔ aka asi idɛyikumbɔ umbɔ awuri inyãmbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">nu abirabɛ aka asi igũmbɔ awuri ihwɛngmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Uish 52.15</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu idikunga irhɛirhɛ umbɔ aka akɛnmbɔ umum ĩba ru umbi.<verse eid="ROM 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu abee izĩ iyepa Uroma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Bɔr icɛrɛ ananga aka ashike ru umum iki itɔ̃ itser ra abĩ akɛrɛ, ikɛi aka adera imɛka irhɛirhɛ umum iki ibee iyepa umbi. <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>Umum ibee ikorhe rimi ivangyɛ umum iki izĩ abĩ Asbaniya. Umum ifosi iba iyepa umbi ivangyɛ umum iki itɔng ni ibee umbi ayika umum ru uzɛ̃rhãmum nggɔɔ ha, ĩba imaamum igũibɛn umbi ukunjiir ni itɔng. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Icɛrɛ, umum iwe ru utsĩndĩ uku uzĩ Urusharhima ri itser iyiki iyike abika adɔsa aka awe umɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Abika adɔsa ru Umakidoniya nu Uakaya agũibɛn idzowe izũwã ayike atsũwã ra aner Uteijee ru Urusharhima. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Agũibɛn ikorha ake, anyanga ngge iwu uvɛrh ru umbɔ. Ubinkutsu atsen abi Uyahuda aba akpombɔ ugau idorh iyi Unum nggu abi Uyahuda, umbɔ awembɔ ru uvɛrh umbɔ aka ifai abi Uyahuda idorh abin upfung. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Nggee umum ĩba imaamum itser iyɛrɛ ni itsuke umbɔ akpombɔ iyiyike ha, umum iso izĩmum Asbaniya ni iyepa umbi ni itɔng. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Umum ihwɛng ugɛ ivangyɛ umum iki iba ru umbi, umum iwuri ikũwã umbi undzumu idorh iyi Ukiristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ru ubok Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo nu ri ibibemu Ipfu-Num hã, àka atsĩ ubokmbi ayika umum ri ititɛ̃wãmum ri ifɛna-Num ru umum. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Àka afɛn-Num ugɛ umum ima ikpo ishishɔɔr ra abok abika asheri imangmang ru Uyahudiya, ikɛi itsermum ru Urusharhima uwe ubin ukpuku uyuyɛi ra abika adɔsa ha aka awu umɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Nggee Unum aba abemunga umum ĩba ru umbi nggu anggɔm ni iwosha nggu umbi. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Unum uwu ididɔɔr ama awe nggu umbi kishoo. Iwerimi.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Undzumu ighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi unapumɛn Ufibi, awu udikin ru ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Ukankiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Umum ibee umbi ayɛi unga ri itsok Uteijee ru utsĩndĩ uwuku uze uwuruwi umbɔ iki iyɛi abika adɔsa na ayike unga ra abinkɛ unga aka abee umbi akorhe, ubinkutsu unga ayikuka anera arhɛrhɛ nggu umum.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Àka aghwe Ubiriskirha nu Uakirha awɛrhi itsermum ru Ukiristo Uyesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Umbɔ atsu atsimbɔ ru uver akpe ru ubokmum. Asi iwea umum ukpekũ itar uwɛɛ, bɔr kishoo abika adɔsa ra atsen abi Uyahuda atar uwɛɛ ru umbɔ igambɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Àka aghwe ikikɔng abika adɔsa ri iyambɔ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:5">Àka aghwe Uabainita, uwuku ugbaashia akɔrh Ukiristo ra abĩ Uasiya.<verse eid="ROM 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Àka aghwe Umaryamu, uwuku utɔ̃wã umbi itser akarhãrhã.<verse eid="ROM 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Àka aghwe Uandaraniku nu Uyunuya, abi Uyahudamɛn, abirabɛ umbɔ aka abow umbɔ ru ugborzĩ nggu umum. Umbɔ awu abirabɛ umbɔ aka ahwɛng ra abi itser Uyesu, awu umbɔ agbaashia ru umum ri iwe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Àka aghwe Uamfirhiyatu uwu umum iki ibema ri itsok Uteijee.<verse eid="ROM 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Àka aghwe Urbanus, uwɛrhi itsermɛn ru Ukiristo, nu uwɛrhamum Usitaki.<verse eid="ROM 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Àka aghwe Uafarhi, uwuruwi umbɔ aka aviri irhirhikanga ru Ukiristo iwe idzidzɛrhe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:10">Àka aghwe aner iya Uaristoburhu.<verse eid="ROM 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Àka aghwe Uhirudiya, Uyahudamɛn.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:11">Àka aghwe abi iya Unarkisu, abirabɛ aka adɔsu Uteijee.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Àka aghwe Utirayifina nu Utirayifusa, akatsɛrh ha abika atɔ̃ itser Uteijee akarhãrhã.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:12">Àka aghwe uwɛrhamum Ufarsi uwuruwi aka atɛ̃wã ri itser Uteijee.<verse eid="ROM 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Àka aghwe Urhufɔ, umbɔ aka asɛng ri itsok Uteijee, nu uyanga aka awu uyamum ikɛi.<verse eid="ROM 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Àka aghwe Uasinkiritu, nu Ufirhigona, nu Uherme, nu Upaturoba, nu Uharma nu abika adɔsa aka awu nggu umbɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Àka aghwe Ufirhorhogu, nu Uyurhiya, nu Uniriyu nu unapumbɔ, nu Uorhimfa, nu kishoo abika adɔsa ha aka awu nggu umbɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Àka aghwe adɔka nggu ighwe ibibema.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:16">Kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsu Ukiristo aghwe umbi.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Umum ifituwa umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, àka akpɔm amɛnmbi nggu abika akũ igigau ru umbi na atsu umbi akwɛr itok ru atsĩndĩmbi ru imesayɛ iki iwiwengge nggu iyimbi aka ayɛi. Niba akhapumbi ru umbɔ! <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Ikpũ anera abɛrɛ asi itɔ̃mbɔ itser Ukiristo Uteijeemɛn, adɔsu ubinkpi amɛnmbɔ aka abee. Ri itonga angwĩmbɔ nu igbɛrangwĩ ukpoimbɔ iki irhɛm abika agũna umbɔ, abika agũna umbɔ awu awɛkaci. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Ubɛn unera aka agũã isarhe ididɔsambi, ngge itsu undzuma anggɔmmum ru umbi, bɔr umum ibee umbi asarasu ra abin aka aze, na awe abika asheru uvau ra abin aka abewe.<verse eid="ROM 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Unum uwu ididɔɔr asi ídãrhunga na ajangu Ushaitan atsu ra andaidakmbi. Imimutu Uteijeemɛn Uyesu ima iwe nggu umbi.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Utimoti, uwɛrhi itsermum, aghwe umbi, rimi hã Urhushiyu, nu Uyason, nu Usosifata, abimɛn abi Uyahuda.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Umum Utartiyu, uwuku utsɛng ubvur uwurɛ, umum ighwe umbi ri itsok Uteijee.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Ugayu, uwuku uyɛi umum ri iyanga, umum nu kishoo abika adɔsa iki igũibɛn ri iyaa, ighwe umbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Uarasta, uwuku ungwɛ̃ abin itser utepa, nu ungwɛ̃mɛn Ukwartu aghwe umbi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha agɔrke ikɛi ugɛ, </char><char style="fv" closed="false">24 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Neke imimuta Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo iwe nggu umbi kishoo. Iwerimi.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Àka akpoi Unum uwuruwi aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ atsu umbi aker ru ubok Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Uyesu Ukiristo umum iki ĩdzowe. Isarhe iyɛrɛ umbɔ awɔke isha rimɔ̃ɔ̃, <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>bɔr icɛrɛ aka akũ adzeka ra awiya ru ubok itsɛng abika asɔm Arherhu-Num. Unga atsu akɛrɛ ngge itsú abĩã kishoo awuri awe ru imangmang na adɔsa unga. <verse eid="ROM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Uzĩ ru Unum uwu itsoi uneke ikpikpoi iwe ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo ugbagbaa! Iwerimi.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
